Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"{", 
  RowBox[{"True", ",", "True", ",", "True"}], "}"}]], "Output",
 CellLabel->"Out[9]=",ExpressionUUID->"16a2f585-33aa-4bcd-96fa-706d0509e240"],

Cell["\<\
Check: {True, True, True}. Changing positions 5 and 6 leaves outputs \
1\[Dash]4 unchanged; the array mask equals AttentionLayer with \"Mask\" -> \
\"Causal\"; with 4 real keys, changing the 2 padding keys changes nothing. In \
Wolfram, padding needs no mask: sequences of different lengths are \
\"Varying\" dimensions, and NetTrain pads and masks them itself.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"ebf58efa-9471-4bdc-b986-3513ed5c54e9"],

Cell["6. Multi-head attention", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"b456f704-e0d8-4da7-adfd-4de815185e2c"],

Cell["\<\
One attention with dmodel-dimensional queries is replaced by h attentions of \
d\:2096 = dmodel/h dimensions each, on different learned projections. Their \
outputs are joined and projected once more (Section 3.2.2):\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"e7af23db-03fd-43d4-be04-023212236b17"],

Cell["\<\
MultiHead(Q, K, V) = Concat(head\:2081, \[Ellipsis], head\:2095) W\:1d3c,     \
 head\:1d62 = Attention(Q W\:1d62^Q, K W\:1d62^K, V W\:1d62^V)\
\>", "Text",
 TextAlignment->Center,
 FontFamily->"Times",
 FontSize->15,
 FontSlant->"Italic",ExpressionUUID->"fecf78d9-6ef3-4e74-9f78-d533ae155276"],

Cell["\<\
As a Wolfram net, mhaNet uses LinearLayer for the projections (all heads at \
once), ReshapeLayer to split the dmodel features into h groups of d\:2096, \
AttentionLayer with \"MultiHead\" -> True for the h attentions, FlattenLayer \
to join them and a last LinearLayer for W\:1d3c.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"fae42c0f-dd48-4dec-95f1-86a653ab0cb6"],

Cell["\<\
In the base model dmodel = 512 and h = 8, so each head works in d\:2096 = 64 \
dimensions. The four projections Q, K, V and W\:1d3c are 512 \[Times] 512 \
matrices with 512 biases each: 4 \[Times] (512\.b2 + 512) = 4 \[Times] 262 \
656 = 1 050 624 parameters, whatever the number of heads.\
\>", "Text",
 CellFrame->{{3, 0}, {0, 0}},
 CellFrameColor->RGBColor[0.83, 0.34, 0.11],
 Background->RGBColor[
  1, 0.97, 0.92],ExpressionUUID->"a91e41b4-8004-448b-97aa-09e8179fd222"],

