Cell["\<\
Check: {True, True, True}. One rotation per offset (k = 1, 5, 17); PE(pos)\
\[CenterDot]PE(pos + 7) is the same for every pos, so it depends only on the \
distance; and peNet (SequenceIndicesLayer, a frozen LinearLayer, Sin) adds \
exactly these codes for any length. Frozen means LearningRateMultipliers -> 0.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"9241509f-388b-4fef-9a8f-0313517fd4fe"],

Cell["8. Feed-forward, residual and LayerNorm", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"c28c28ab-c38e-44f6-997f-a37c9d952e6f"],

Cell["\<\
After attention, every position goes through the same two-layer network on \
its own: dmodel \[RightArrow] dff \[RightArrow] dmodel with a ReLU between \
(dff = 2048 in the base model; Section 3.3). Every sub-layer is wrapped in a \
residual connection and followed by layer normalisation (Section 3.1):\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"2b7bdc47-e21b-4ac0-ac2e-74955be26c91"],

Cell["\<\
FFN(x) = max(0, x W\:2081 + b\:2081) W\:2082 + b\:2082          output = \
LayerNorm(x + Sublayer(x))          LayerNorm(v) = \[Gamma] (v \[Minus] mean \
v) / \[Sqrt](var v + \[CurlyEpsilon]) + \[Beta]\
\>", "Text",
 TextAlignment->Center,
 FontFamily->"Times",
 FontSize->15,
 FontSlant->"Italic",ExpressionUUID->"488aed5e-2d5d-4efa-8dba-dc28c0465af4"],

Cell["\<\
The residual lets the signal and its gradient pass straight through. The \
normalisation keeps every position\[CloseCurlyQuote]s vector at mean 0 and \
variance 1 before a learned scale \[Gamma] and shift \[Beta].\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"74924262-b85a-4874-8120-cde08e8edfa6"],

Cell["\<\
LayerNorm of v = (1, 2, 3) with \[Gamma] = 1, \[Beta] = 0: the mean is 2 and \
the variance (1 + 0 + 1)/3 = 2/3. With \[CurlyEpsilon] = 0.001, \[Sqrt](2/3 + \
0.001) = 0.8171, so the result is (\[Minus]1, 0, 1)/0.8171 = (\[Minus]1.2238, \
0, 1.2238). Without \[CurlyEpsilon] it would be \[PlusMinus]1.2247.\
\>", "Text",
 CellFrame->{{3, 0}, {0, 0}},
 CellFrameColor->RGBColor[0.83, 0.34, 0.11],
 Background->RGBColor[
  1, 0.97, 0.92],ExpressionUUID->"2a511218-3b2c-44b2-bfff-3d89e15a997e"],

